      *    MOVE FRT-CARRIER           TO  CARRIER-OUT.
      *    MOVE FRT-CHARGES-9         TO  FRT-CHRG-OUT.
      *    IF FRT-CTR = 1
      ******   IF INV-PAY-REPORT-TYPE
      *            MOVE 2             TO  INV-PAY-CTL.
      *            MOVE INV-DETAIL-10 TO  INV-PAY-REPORT-LINE.
      *            PERFORM 5-WRITE-INVPAY-REPORT-LINE.
      *
      **** IF INV-PAY-REPORT-TYPE
      *        MOVE 1                 TO  INV-PAY-CTL.
      *        MOVE INV-DETAIL-11     TO  INV-PAY-REPORT-LINE.
      *        PERFORM 5-WRITE-INVPAY-REPORT-LINE.
      *
      *    GO TO 67-GET-DPOFREIGHT-LOOP.
